<title>FRANCE: RESEARCH ALERT - AXA-UAP UPGRADED TO OUTPERFORM.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AXA-UAP UPGRADED TO OUTPERFORM.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNP Equities has upgraded AXA-UAP from average performer to outperformer after its U.S. unit, Equitable Co, posted good first half results, BNP Equities said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analysts at BNP Equities said the French insurer's share had underperformed the CAC-40 index of blue-chip shares by three percent since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>They said they were awaiting further information from the company when it publishes its results on October 30, especially on the state of its consolidated capital after the merger of UAP and AXA.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
